{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>In all My house he is trusted.</b> Its meaning: like a member of the household, who enters without permission, and if he needs to, he speaks his needs. But you — when I make Myself known to you in a dream, you know; and if not, you have no permission to ask."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:22.755575489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}